     "body": "<p>A similar fix was included in v3.4.0, see also:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/v3.4/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/journal/readerwriter/multicast/rmi/RmiTransport.java\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/blob/v3.4/fcrepo-server/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/server/journal/readerwriter/multicast/rmi/RmiTransport.java</a></p>",
